    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44243" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκί̄ν-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily moved, agile</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				58e
			</span></i>; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότατον εἶδος</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				56a
			</span></i>; -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερον ψυχὴ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MM</u>
					1199b32
				</span></i>
			; -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότατον τὸ σφαιροειδές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>de An.</u>
					405a12
				</span></i>
			, al.; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				491b13
			</span></i>; <i>mobile</i>, of troops, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.40.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easily moved, changeable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				8b35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ</span>.
			<i>fickleness</i>, Hdn <i><span class="en">
				7.7.1
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.95
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>easily moved, inclinable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς
				ἀρετήν, πρὸς ὀργήν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				13a27
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1379a26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀδικίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zaleuc.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.2.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐέλεγκτος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				991a16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> of language,
				<i>flowing, graceful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				994.35
			</span></i>.</div>
